    {
      "id": "2026-11-08-vllm-pr-60130",
      "event_key": "vllm-pr-60130",
      "title": "vLLM CPU KV卸载：单rank统一映射，大页不足在启动时失败",
      "summary": "11月7日07:12:22Z合并7a07e2342e7e857133d3964bd4b7022103a5b030。SimpleCPUOffloadConnector把每rank各层CPU KV改为同一mmap中的视图，按实际解析的KV块数定容，再向页大小取整。可选2MiB/1GiB HugeTLB，默认普通页；继承worker的NUMA策略，预填充发现hugetlb/cgroup不足即启动失败，不静默回落。CUDA注册最多256GiB一段，边界同时对齐KV块与实际后备页，pin/unpin一一对应；MADV_DONTFORK避免子进程继承固定页。",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/pulls/60130",
        "https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/commits/7a07e2342e",
        "https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/releases?per_page=6"
      ],
      "update_of": null,
      "article_id": "inference-engines"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-08-sglang-pr-47984",
      "event_key": "sglang-pr-47984",
      "title": "SGLang混合状态复制：分块限制临时显存尖峰",
      "summary": "11月7日04:49:54Z合并784cffe3d90bb625041f9c0b4f06e66b0a122e42。MambaPool.copy_from原先一次高级索引gather全部源slot，临时显存为slot数×单slot大小，前缀写时复制突发可能在静态池之外OOM。现在temporal状态按64MiB预算分块，至少1slot；小复制保持单次赋值，融合与fallback路径都调用同一helper，conv部分不变。源/目的slot必须不重叠，调试模式在真正分块时断言。",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/pulls/47984",
        "https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/commits/784cffe3d9",
        "https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/issues/47916",
        "https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/releases?per_page=6",
        "https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/commits/edee938b5b5227fa0f98070abd247bbef592180b/check-runs?per_page=100"
      ],
      "update_of": null,
      "article_id": "inference-engines"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-08-sglang-pr-48375",
      "event_key": "sglang-pr-48375",
      "title": "SGLang P/D握手：先核草稿KV布局，再登记传输目标",
      "summary": "11月7日09:30:05Z合并043cfc4d3a2cc2a931d15862f08c4b60b692c957。DSpark/DFlash预填充由目标hidden states生成草稿KV，decode无法只凭token元数据重建。新spec_kv_layout随已有bootstrap PUT /route发布algorithm和num_draft_entries；Python/Rust注册表保留跨prefill rank首个非空布局并拒绝已知冲突。Decode在登记prefill目标前比较布局，算法/entry数不符或target-only decode拒绝；无草稿PP阶段和state-only draft跳过。",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/pulls/48375",
        "https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/commits/043cfc4d3a2cc2a931d15862f08c4b60b692c957",
        "https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/releases?per_page=6",
        "https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/commits/6bc59350462cbda8833ec130947e2e73578302c1/check-runs?per_page=100"
      ],
      "update_of": null,
      "article_id": "inference-engines"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-08-lmcache-pr-5713",
      "event_key": "lmcache-pr-5713",
      "title": "LMCache：LoRA隔离要贯穿缓存键与延迟写回",
      "summary": "11月5日19:41:34Z合并ea6ecd0，修复MP连接器把基座及不同LoRA的相同token/cache_salt视为同一KV的问题。请求tracker从真实LoRA name+path生成128-bit BLAKE2b标签，丢弃客户端自报lora标签、保留租户cache_salt；服务端将tag纳入lookup/store/retrieve/lock-release对象身份，lazy offload合并写回也保留request_configs。依赖#5843和已合并#6199。",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://api.github.com/repos/LMCache/LMCache/pulls/5713",
        "https://api.github.com/repos/LMCache/LMCache/pulls/5713/files?per_page=100",
        "https://api.github.com/repos/LMCache/LMCache/pulls/6199",
        "https://api.github.com/repos/LMCache/LMCache/commits?since=2026-11-04T23:26:19Z&until=2026-11-07T23:26:19Z&per_page=100",
        "https://api.github.com/repos/LMCache/LMCache/releases?per_page=3"
      ],
      "update_of": null,
      "article_id": "model-serving-gpu"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-08-groot-h100-trt-finite-mask-4d9f888",
      "event_key": "groot-h100-trt-finite-mask-4d9f888",
      "title": "GR00T：长padding下先保证H100动作输出有限",
      "summary": "11月6日23:42:30Z主线4d9f888将ONNX/TensorRT导出的DiT自注意力和缓存cross-attention掩码统一为计算dtype中的0/最小有限值，代替负无穷；避免H100融合attention在长padding下连有效token也产生NaN。与同批VL掩码导出和11/7#802组合测试配套，严格VL和动作padding掩码均须保留。",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/Isaac-GR00T/commits/4d9f8886fcf3023ece9c5138b7ebfeffc40aedf7",
